Known divergence (2026-11-11): Bundler 4.0.24 raises SolveFailure (exit 6) with a PubGrub explanation ("Because every version of future_gem depends on Ruby >= 99.0 ... version solving has failed."), while Celerite raises GemNotFound (exit 7) listing the source candidates. Tracked as an M7(1) error-semantics gap; remove this deferral once the resolver reports a solve failure for Ruby-incompatible-only candidates.
